Package: power-timer
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-tk
Maintainer: Power Timer <noreply@localhost>
Description: Suspend, restart or shut down after a delay or at a set time
 A small desktop app with a settings window and a minimal full-screen
 countdown. Runs the chosen action through systemd when the timer ends.
